## Tasks in order

### Q1: {{OUTCOME}} [ready]

Why: {{USER_VALUE_OR_RISK}}
Scope and exclusions: {{BOUNDARIES}}
Dependencies: {{PREREQUISITES_OR_NONE}}
Read: {{RELEVANT_EXISTING_FILES_OR_NONE_YET}}
Decided with the owner: {{DATED_ANSWERS_OR_NONE_YET}}
Acceptance: {{OBSERVABLE_CHECKS_AND_REQUIRED_EVIDENCE}}
Evidence: none yet.

If interrupted, record here: current result, changed/uncommitted files, missing
checks, external residue, and exact next action. If blocked, record the owner and
unblock condition. Replace obsolete resume instructions when work continues.

When a task reaches done or rejected, move its whole block unchanged, evidence
included, to the end of `project-context/done.md`. Create that file with the heading
`# Done items` if needed. Add a line for the task under Done. A deferred task stays
here, and so does a task whose status says part of the work is still open.

