## Done

Finished tasks, one line each, oldest first. Full text is in `project-context/done.md`.

{{ONE_LINE_PER_FINISHED_TASK_OR_NONE_YET}}

Write each line as `- Q4: <title> [done 2026-09-15]`. Use the finish date the block
states. Never take a date from the evidence, and leave it out if none is stated.
